{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105793","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105793/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105793/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105793/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105793","id":3022022429,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UBIYT","number":105793,"title":"Core: Add initial architecture for first-class `Object` types. Optimize `is_class`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-04-26T15:25:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T14:15:36Z","closed_at":"2025-10-06T14:13:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105793","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105793.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105793.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-06T14:13:04Z"},"body":"- ~Requires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105192 (for refactor reasons).~\r\n- Follow-up: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106016\r\n\r\nThis is a first step towards adding first-class types to Godot.\r\nThis is better explained in the proposal: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12323.\r\n\r\nAfter this PR, we can slowly build on top of it to move things from `ClassDB` into `GDType`.\r\n\r\n## Implementation\r\n\r\nI piggy-back off the previous `get_class_namev` scaffolding, using the same mechanism to use and assign `GDType *` instead. For this reason, the implementation is safe and battle tested before being implemented.\r\n\r\nIn particular, each `Object` owns a `const GDType *` to its own type. The type exposes methods for getting type-related information.\r\n\r\nI make use of this new construct by optimizing `is_class`. Currently, it is implemented as a virtual function, which uses `GDCLASS` to check against static `StringName` singletons:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/core/object/object.h#L432-L437\r\n\r\nThis is slow, not just because various checks were repeatedly called for each subclass, but also because the elements weren't local in memory, and each had to be put into cache separately.\r\nInstead, I create a constant `LocalVector` of the hierarchy for each type, and simply loop through it to find the queried class name.\r\n(This would be _much_ faster if the argument was a `StringName` instead of `String`, but that will happen sooner or later anyway as the code is refactored and optimized)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\nI benchmarked a ~3x improvement of `is_class`. The improvement would likely be better outside benchmarks because there are fewer cache misses.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\t// Setup\r\n\tNode3D *node = memnew(Node3D);\r\n\tString class_name = \"Node2D\";\r\n\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 500000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t// Test\r\n\t\tnode->is_class(class_name);\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis printed:\r\n- `7845ms` on master\r\n- `2662ms` on this PR\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105793/reactions","total_count":47,"+1":22,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":9,"eyes":8},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105793/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}